fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth264parser.html#gst_h264_parser_parse_sei","fragment":"\n\tgst_h264_parser_parse_sei\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.prototype.h264_parser_parse_sei\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.h264_parser_parse_sei\n\nParses nalu containing one or more Supplementary Enhancement Information messages,\nand allocates and fills the messages array.\nParameters:\na GstH264NalParser\nThe GST_H264_NAL_SEI GstH264NalUnit to parse\nThe GArray of GstH264SEIMessage to fill. The caller must free it when done.\na GstH264ParserResult\nParses nalu containing one or more Supplementary Enhancement Information messages,\nand allocates and fills the messages array.\nParameters:\na GstCodecParsers.H264NalParser\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnitType.SEI GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnit to parse\nThe GArray of GstCodecParsers.H264SEIMessage to fill. The caller must free it when done.\na GstCodecParsers.H264ParserResult\nParses nalu containing one or more Supplementary Enhancement Information messages,\nand allocates and fills the messages array.\nParameters:\na GstCodecParsers.H264NalParser\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnitType.SEI GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnit to parse\nThe GArray of GstCodecParsers.H264SEIMessage to fill. The caller must free it when done.\na GstCodecParsers.H264ParserResult\n"});